    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="15">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 15</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And se þe in cynges byrig oððon on his neaweste feohteð oððe steleð, he bið feorhscyldig, nimþe se cyng alyfan wille þat man wergylde alysan mote.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And anyone who fights or steals in the king’s compound or in his vicinity is to be condemned to death, unless the king permits that he may be redeemed with his wergild.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 se þe in cynges byrig oððon on his neaweste feohteð oððe steleð, he bið feorhscyldig, nimþe se cyng alyfan wille, þat man wergy[lde] alysan mote.</ab>
      </div>
